cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and identify the commit used for your experiment."
type: software
title: "FedCAID: Federated Class Adapter Intrusion Detection"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://gitee.com/liuluz/fed-caid"
license: "Apache-2.0"
authors:
  - name: "liulu"
abstract: >-
  Research software for a shared intrusion-detection procedure across four
  independent in-vehicle CAN and external-network proxy dataset federations,
  with local cross-PLE-TabM detectors, class-score adaptation, two-collector
  secure aggregation, private personalization, and hierarchical decisions.
keywords:
  - intrusion detection
  - Internet of Vehicles
  - federated learning
  - secure aggregation
